From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:55:04 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Windows 10 Mobile: no camera and microphone previews in the
 permission prompt

A phone streams one camera at a time: the prompt's preview held the front
camera, so the back one could not be picked in it, its frames came out
green, and with the previews the prompt grew taller than the screen (its
last button under the system's bar). The prompt asks without them; the page
picks the device.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../permission_prompt_bubble_one_origin_view.cc          | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/views/permissions/permission_prompt_bubble_one_origin_view.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/views/permissions/permission_prompt_bubble_one_origin_view.cc
index 389216c2cf2a87ce9542052188f6a4fa328df427..0518b787e90b01b8ca0de609f55e5520db02cafe 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/views/permissions/permission_prompt_bubble_one_origin_view.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/views/permissions/permission_prompt_bubble_one_origin_view.cc
@@ -283,10 +283,19 @@ void PermissionPromptBubbleOneOriginView::MaybeAddMediaPreview(
     OnAudioDevicesChanged(cached_device_info->GetAudioDeviceInfos());
   }
 
+#if defined(VENETIUM_W10M)
+  // Windows 10 Mobile: no camera and microphone previews in the prompt. A
+  // phone streams one camera at a time, which the preview held (another
+  // could not be picked, and the page waited for it), its frames came out
+  // green, and the prompt grew taller than the screen. The page picks the
+  // device.
+  return;
+#else
   media_previews_.emplace(browser(), this, index,
                           requested_audio_capture_device_ids,
                           requested_video_capture_device_ids);
 #endif
+#endif
 }
 
 #if !BUILDFLAG(IS_CHROMEOS)
